> - 条件/判断类：跨色重叠变色(cross_color_overlap_recolor), 推断对称轴(infer_symmetry_axes), 各区域缺像素(region_miss_pixel), 互换原型(toggle_to_alternate_prototype), 八方向匹配(all_orientations_matching), 孔洞保留不填(holes_preserved), 双背景标记输出(both_bg_marks), 碎片锚定放置位(fragment_anchor_place), 块解码为掩码(decode_block_to_mask), 像素匹配掩码位置(pixels_match_mask_positions), 标记位决定展开(marker_pos_sets_expansion), 邻域全包含(full_neighborhood_inside_component), 最大内部面积胜出(largest_interior_wins), 输出纯色小块(output_solid_block), 重叠定先后(overlap_determines), 差异分类着色(diff_class_color), 归一化形状对应(normalized_match), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 像素数决定尺寸(pixel_count_sets_size), 双层图案叠加(two_level_pattern), 朝向交换长度保持(orient_swap_keep), 尾部决定平移(tail_determines_shift), 高频色定印章位(dominant_color_selects_pos)
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

